      "count": 2,
      "raw_count": 2,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "鄢陵公國相，不之官。明年，左降松滋侯相。太安中，棄官歸家，與顧榮等共誅陳敏，語在榮傳。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
